        "quiz_id": 3528,
        "type": "writing",
        "title": "It is the responsibility of schools to teach children good behavior in addition to providing formal education. To what extent do you agree or disagree?",
        "status": "draft",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GhROdSf3koj7hMxWnN3lC9ZZgag\"><em><strong>It is the responsibility of schools to teach children good behavior in addition to providing</strong></em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kic7d5boCo4j1HxgUPyld8sPgBg\"><em><strong>formal education. To what extent do you agree or disagree?</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Teaching Good Behavior<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong> <a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/essay-structure-logical-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theo Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></a></strong></span></em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Hiểu đề &amp; viết Introduction:</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CDFKduFuko3ahTxe765l81SCg6f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Đề Teaching Good Behavior&nbsp;cho 1 quan điểm:</strong> tr&aacute;ch nhiệm của nh&agrave; trường l&agrave; dạy trẻ em h&agrave;nh vi tốt b&ecirc;n cạnh việc gi&aacute;o dục.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NMrCdb1huo1sq2xVPDTlTZKdgAf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Dạng c&acirc;u hỏi:</strong> Bạn đồng &yacute; hay kh&ocirc;ng đồng &yacute; với &yacute; kiến n&agrave;y?</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BQBcdd9F2oIUuDxncMPliNmlgeD\">Dựa v&agrave;o đề b&agrave;i Teaching Good Behavior&nbsp;v&agrave; c&acirc;u hỏi, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể viết được phần Introduction. Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, phần Introduction lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; 2 c&acirc;u:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NTRXdi4KIopiUGxT8VVln0UhgYe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1:</strong> Paraphrase đề b&agrave;i</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QVc7dijGtoC7VaxgM26lIx0nghd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2:</strong> Thesis statement - Trả lời c&acirc;u hỏi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DX2hdEoZhoIa4Bx6ZRolvr7Qgoc\"><em>(*) Bạn học&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://rebrand.ly/intro-to-what-extent\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">c&aacute;ch viết Introduction cho dạng To what extent</span> </a></strong>ở đ&acirc;y nh&eacute;.</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZk7dcHWdoNqdwxlzr7lEbBDgJh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NpHZdtwL9okiQfxKcGTljGQ2gch\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>shoulder the responsbility for doing sth <em>(g&aacute;nh v&aacute;c tr&aacute;ch nhiệm li&ecirc;n quan đến việc g&igrave;)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AUxLdwnbKof5AxxE7qFlhlHMgTg\">\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY:</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pklmddy9Bo7tzyxz8N8lq70Dgyb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FpNbd7IdBoA4Ctx6gxsl4JN5gie\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OWsUdfdiSo5zJSxHBAElqPqPgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DnoWda9NLoogFOxHQgvljDWwgQI\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y0VTdv3RjoVBMUxyY6glDwkugHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xxw3dzwzloLfvMx31Ozl4U5Rgdd\">Bạn n&ecirc;n n&oacute;i r&otilde; quan điểm của m&igrave;nh l&agrave; đồng &yacute;, hoặc kh&ocirc;ng đồng &yacute; với quan điểm của đề. Ở đ&acirc;y, theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>&nbsp;với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong>, YouPass sẽ chọn quan điểm '<strong>kh&ocirc;ng</strong> <strong>đồng &yacute; ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n'</strong>, v&igrave; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh tin rằng <strong>phụ huynh mới thật sự l&agrave; người g&aacute;nh v&aacute;c tr&aacute;ch nhiệm ch&iacute;nh trong việc dạy con c&aacute;i về h&agrave;nh vi tốt.</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UFLZdz74cozwYCxk11OlnMueg4d\"><em>(*) Bạn t&igrave;m hiểu về bản chất của <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong> ở b&agrave;i học thử n&agrave;y nh&eacute;: <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cach-lap-luan-4060\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic lập luận dạng 'To What Extent'</a></strong></span></em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JC1fdg7cgoDNZkxUTw9lC5dugjb\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận Partly Agree</strong> th&igrave; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ sắp xếp &yacute; tưởng v&agrave;o 2 BODY như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PaGYdDeVNoWKx0xDxxwldx6FgXb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 1:</strong> M&igrave;nh sẽ thừa nhận rằng nh&agrave; trường cũng c&oacute; vai tr&ograve; trong việc ph&aacute;t triển h&agrave;nh vi tốt ở trẻ.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JF3ldZWLYoWDUSxeRVTlf6KMgPb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 2:</strong> Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm c&aacute; nh&acirc;n rằng phụ huynh mới thật sự l&agrave; người g&aacute;nh v&aacute;c tr&aacute;ch nhiệm ch&iacute;nh trong việc dạy con c&aacute;i về h&agrave;nh vi tốt.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E6xsduRXyo7PgoxfRdNlJsyWgCb\"><em>(*) Nếu bạn chưa nắm vững về cấu tr&uacute;c đoạn văn v&agrave; logic ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>th&igrave; bạn h&atilde;y xem c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học sau trước khi viết b&agrave;i theo gợi &yacute; ở bước 3 nh&eacute;:</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZCi8dUtrIoNNTTx7gl3llDpYgUL\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cau-truc-doan-van\" target=\"_self\">Logic sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong paragraph</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jvy7dry7XoJRCyx1bgulj2smgZf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-reason-impact\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Reason v&agrave; Impact</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-example\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Example</a></strong></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 1: </strong>Thừa nhận rằng nh&agrave; trường cũng c&oacute; vai tr&ograve; trong việc ph&aacute;t triển h&agrave;nh vi tốt ở trẻ</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GGx2dtMsVo2SRMxTaHOlDGY0gIh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OUsndgv96oXwDFxW1FrloHVrgAe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GRTBdEWugofGoixOPJblvMOygNU\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CqPEd28cco0ycmxZHuQlljkHgMe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T4nldWXyRoUmvgxl7nOldzdAgIf\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Topic sentence:</span> </strong>Phải thừa nhận rằng, trường học mang đến một <em>m&ocirc;i trường x&atilde; hội (social environment)</em> quan trọng để trẻ em thực h&agrave;nh ph&aacute;t triển h&agrave;nh vi ph&ugrave; hợp.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Uv0tdVLr1oDJGPx8wBwltSisggb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EGFJd4AHyoyPhyxHlCklOPXBgBh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1</strong>: Trong m&ocirc;i trường lớp học, học sinh c&oacute; cơ hội tương t&aacute;c với nhiều bạn b&egrave; đến từ c&aacute;c ho&agrave;n cảnh kh&aacute;c nhau v&agrave; học c&aacute;ch <em>giải quyết xung đột (resolve conflicts)</em> một c&aacute;ch mang t&iacute;nh x&acirc;y dựng</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NblDdPomIoIXi8xxboNlo2BXgzb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Example: </strong>C&aacute;c hoạt động nh&oacute;m v&agrave; <em>dự &aacute;n chung (collaborative projects)</em> buộc học sinh phải điều chỉnh h&agrave;nh vi của m&igrave;nh để <em>ph&ugrave; hợp với quy tắc chung (conform with common rules)</em>, gi&uacute;p c&aacute;c em ph&aacute;t triển kỹ năng hợp t&aacute;c v&agrave; t&ocirc;n trọng &yacute; kiến kh&aacute;c biệt - những kỹ năng x&atilde; hội quan trọng kh&ocirc;ng dễ thực h&agrave;nh <em>ở nh&agrave; (in the family environment)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EO9KdO84boNUvWxhmAWleT5Ogeg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R3Kdd2RWnoToAmxUQtcl6uVrgAf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2:</strong> gi&aacute;o vi&ecirc;n đ&oacute;ng vai tr&ograve; như những người <em>hướng dẫn chuy&ecirc;n nghiệp (professional guides)</em> trong qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh ph&aacute;t triển h&agrave;nh vi.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L23Zd4oxyosKfPxNRcgluGbtgzh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason + Impact:</strong> Với kiến thức chuy&ecirc;n m&ocirc;n về <em>t&acirc;m l&yacute; trẻ em (child psychology)</em>, c&aacute;c nh&agrave; gi&aacute;o dục c&oacute; thể <em>nhận diện c&aacute;c h&agrave;nh vi c&oacute; vấn đề (identify problematic behaviors)</em> v&agrave; <em>thực hiện c&aacute;c biện ph&aacute;p can thiệp ph&ugrave; hợp (implement appropriate interventions), </em>từ đ&oacute; cung cấp cho học sinh những phản hồi về việc tương t&aacute;c x&atilde; hội của c&aacute;c em, gi&uacute;p ch&uacute;ng ph&aacute;t triển <em>sự tự nhận thức (self-awareness)</em> v&agrave; <em>tr&iacute; tuệ cảm x&uacute;c (emotional intelligence)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 2: </strong>Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm c&aacute; nh&acirc;n rằng phụ huynh mới thật sự l&agrave; người g&aacute;nh v&aacute;c tr&aacute;ch nhiệm ch&iacute;nh trong việc dạy con c&aacute;i về h&agrave;nh vi tốt</span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KrtVdtupRoKL6sxjDB2lsqewgkf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IpmcdM2KVo20yvx1AcclbEoFgNe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WdeNdWsDkoHkxfxFq99lekOpgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zq8Ed5ZPxoJixmxjWwPlsAd9gQ8\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9QVdRGxLozW5JxLNrOlZt4TgTh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, t&ocirc;i tin rằng phụ huynh đ&oacute;ng vai tr&ograve; quan trọng hơn trong việc định h&igrave;nh h&agrave;nh vi của trẻ em.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AuJqd2KrPouML6xhG7ul9QHsgBg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CufadjuOMo2PFrxWHiDlCITigqe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1: </strong>Gia đ&igrave;nh l&agrave; <em>người thầy đầu ti&ecirc;n về đạo đức (the first teacher of morals)</em>, giới thiệu cho trẻ em những kh&aacute;i niệm cơ bản về đ&uacute;ng v&agrave; sai từ l&acirc;u trước khi trẻ bắt đầu đi học ch&iacute;nh thức ở trường.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GghVdYqKso6Z2AxQMG3lhlovgSf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact: </strong><em>Nền tảng đạo đức sớm (early foundation)</em> n&agrave;y rất cần thiết v&igrave; n&oacute; <em>thiết lập khu&ocirc;n khổ đạo đức (establish the ethical framework)</em> m&agrave; tất cả c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học về h&agrave;nh vi trong tương lai sẽ dựa v&agrave;o</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CDL5dNdiCohnh9xTAXMlATDVgub\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gr4udX4vToMvQwx1FWUloFLrg9c\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2:</strong> mối li&ecirc;n kết t&igrave;nh cảm giữa cha mẹ v&agrave; con c&aacute;i tạo ra m&ocirc;i trường tin cậy gi&uacute;p việc ph&aacute;t triển h&agrave;nh vi tốt trở n&ecirc;n hiệu quả hơn.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HazjdDa9moQkC2xoAlzljFt2gmc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason + Impact:</strong> Khi trẻ em nhận được sự hướng dẫn từ người m&agrave; ch&uacute;ng tin tưởng s&acirc;u sắc, ch&uacute;ng c&oacute; nhiều khả năng <em>nội h&oacute;a c&aacute;c gi&aacute; trị (internalize values)</em> v&agrave; &aacute;p dụng ch&uacute;ng một c&aacute;ch nhất qu&aacute;n trong c&aacute;c t&igrave;nh huống kh&aacute;c nhau.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Viết Conclusion:</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jx3IdxsyToocMyxrcHBlR5M4gTb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z215dilK9oetfOxPDFol02JKgkg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JRbGdLxfwoyo3LxfaWvlKYZxgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S41gdx1Yho0RQhxH1Zclco4KgPH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MDkodyWDGo2nbTx3llNlDkiTgye\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bạn h&atilde;y viết Conclusion bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>t&oacute;m tắt c&aacute;c luận điểm ch&iacute;nh v&agrave; khẳng định lại quan điểm</strong> của m&igrave;nh nh&eacute;!</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QWprd3T1aoidM5xP4Pbl2JIpgff\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XqGKdEy33oGVizxdhJbljpxMgAf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">behavioral development <em>(sự ph&aacute;t triển về h&agrave;nh vi)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 857,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mk1jdOkJboby6HxMU4Ali1regmb\">Opinions are divided on whether schools have the responsibility to teach children good behavior alongside providing formal education. Although schools can contribute to children's behavioral development, I believe parents are the ones who bear the primary responsibility for teaching their children about good behavior.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14850,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 858,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p>Admittedly, schools provide an important social environment for children to practice appropriate behavior. In the classroom environment, students have opportunities to interact with many peers from different backgrounds and learn how to resolve conflicts constructively. Group activities and collaborative projects require students to adjust their behavior to conform with common rules, helping them develop cooperation skills and respect for different opinions - important social skills that are not easily practiced in the family environment. Moreover, teachers serve as professional guides in behavioral development. With their specialized knowledge of child psychology, educators can identify problematic behaviors and implement appropriate intervention, thereby providing students with professional feedback on their social interactions that helps them develop self-awareness and emotional intelligence.</p>",
            "question_id": 14850,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 859,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XQozdNeNiolAkexJLxLl6hQ0g3f\">However, I believe that parents play a more important role in shaping children's behavior. Family is the first teacher of morals, introducing children to basic concepts of right and wrong long before formal education begins. This early moral foundation is essential as it establishes the ethical framework upon which all future behavioral teachings will build. Additionally, the emotional connection between parents and children creates an environment of trust that facilitates more effective learning. When children receive guidance from someone they deeply trust, they are more likely to internalize values and apply them consistently across different situations.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14850,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 860,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BzKgd3PHZoSwA9xmteBlwydEgOh\">In conclusion, while schools contribute to behavioral development through structured social environments and professional guidance, parents remain the primary influence thanks to their early moral teaching and strong emotional connections with their children.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14850,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
